			"itemType": "note",
			"note": "<div data-schema-version=\"8\"><h1>Heading one</h1><h2>Heading <em>two</em></h2><p>First paragraph.</p><blockquote><p>Quoted one.</p><p>Quoted two.</p></blockquote><ul><li><p>bullet</p></li><li><p>second</p><ul><li><p>nested</p></li></ul></li></ul><ol start=\"3\"><li><p>three</p></li><li><p>four</p></li></ol><pre>code\n  block &lt;x&gt;</pre><p style=\"padding-left: 40px\">Indented paragraph<br>second line</p><p style=\"padding-left: 80px\">Twice indented</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through\">struck</span> and <code>inline*code</code> with * star, _under_, # hash and `tick`.</p><hr><table><tbody><tr><th>A</th><th>B</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table><p>- not a list<br>1. not numbered<br>&gt; not a quote</p></div>",
